# Original MIT Z80 port/status probe for Issue #71. Enter at 0100h.
# Maps RAM, sets SCREEN 5 / 212 / IL+EO, uploads green/blue page rows,
# sounds PSG A, polls S#2.EO and stores parity/count at C200/C201.
# Every eight edges: NTSC IL -> PAL IL -> PAL -> NTSC -> repeat.
# No proprietary firmware, emulator service calls or production timing helpers.
